rs_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":12,"created_at":"2025-02-16T19:02:45Z","updated_at":"2025-07-25T01:57:15Z","closed_at":"2025-07-25T01:57:15Z","assignee":{"login":"vnen","id":5599796,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1OTk3OTY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5599796?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vnen","html_url":"https://github.com/vnen","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vnen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vnen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vnen/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vnen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vnen/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vnen/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vnen/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vnen/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vnen/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in v4.4.beta3.official [06acfccf8]\n- Reproducible in v4.4.beta2.official [a013481b0]\n- Reproducible in v4.4.dev7.official [46c8f8c5c]\n- Reproducible in v4.4.dev5.official [9e6098432]\n- Reproducible in v4.4.dev3.official [f4af8201b] <---- **Appeared there**\n- Not reproducible in v4.4.dev2.official [97ef3c837] \n- Not occurring in v4.3.stable.official [77dcf97d8] since Typed Dictionaries (https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/78656) were introduced in 4.4.dev2\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.beta3 - Windows 11 (build 26100) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - AMD Radeon RX 6600 (Advanced Micro Devices, Inc.; 32.0.11037.4004) - AMD Ryzen 7 2700X Eight-Core Processor (16 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhile investigating for https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100458, I got this error while typing code:\n\n`ERROR: Attempted to getptr a variable of type 'Nil' into a TypedDictionary.Key of type 'String'.`\n\nIt happens when accessing a **constant** dictionary with a **defined type** for its **key** within a **for loop** iterating a **declared typed array for its key.**\n- Does not happen with non constant dictionary\n- Does not happen with non typed Dictionaries (or just typed as `Dictionary`)\n- Does not happen if the type for the key is Variant\n- Does not happen if the array iterating is non typed  (or just as `Array`)\n\nEx: \n```gdscript\nconst dict: Dictionary[String, int] = {\n\t\t\"a\": 12\n\t}\n\nvar n: Array[String] = [\"a\", \"b\", \"c\"]\n\nfor s in n:\n\tdict[s]. # <--- type anything here and you get the error\n```\n\nIt's thrown by https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/f42e612da286b14b3a50eff7935615b3bc132c37/core/variant/container_type_validate.h#L103\n\nI tested `float`, `int` and `String` for the key / array and all of them threw the error.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Declare a constant typed dictionary\n- Declare a typed array (same as key)\n- Iterate through the array and access the dictionary with the iterator\n- Try to access any property / method from this value\n- Get the error\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[GetPtrError.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18815944/GetPtrError.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102926/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102926/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}